[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3104837310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108878#issuecomment-3104837310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108878","id":3104837310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65EA6-","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T21:08:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T21:08:15Z","body":"Regular properties have the same problem, so not sure why metadata should be special. Ideally we should have some way to detect duplicates and disambiguate them.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3104837310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3104873600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108878#issuecomment-3104873600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108878","id":3104873600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65EJyA","user":{"login":"Changryy","id":35406747,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NDA2NzQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35406747?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy","html_url":"https://github.com/Changryy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Changryy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T21:23:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T21:23:09Z","body":"The special case with metadata is that you retrieve the data using the name of the metadata. And since the name is a string you dont get any autocompletion or validity check while writing the code, which can lead to unexpected errors if you wrote it with incorrect capitalisation. This makes it more important to be able to see the exact name of the metadata.\r\n\r\nAdditionally metadata is a string that you define in the editor, so an argument can be made that it should follow the same rules as other types of strings you can define in the editor, like groups and resource names (both of which dont have any special styling)\r\n<img width=\"167\" height=\"77\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d257589-7ff3-4cd5-9849-d61da773f7f6\" />\r\n<img width=\"256\" height=\"49\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b070699-3ce0-4397-a0c1-f072a1895ab3\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reac