ments/3118040132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108878#issuecomment-3118040132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108878","id":3118040132,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc652YRE","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T14:25:24Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T14:26:25Z","body":"I'm not convinced.\r\n\r\n> Regular properties have the same problem, so not sure why metadata should be special. Ideally we should have some way to detect duplicates and disambiguate them.\r\n\r\nI agree with @KoBeWi even if they approved the PR afterwards.\r\n\r\nAs every property, the docs are invoked when hovering. And the literal name is given there. So I don't see why it should be an exception.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"850\" height=\"191\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-07-25 à 10 23 34\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5bd4079-355a-472a-89d0-ef968d92de43\" />\r\n<img width=\"866\" height=\"230\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-07-25 à 10 23 44\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/594c099f-339c-4119-a6b5-9b5543901472\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3118040132/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5105268591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108878#issuecomment-5105268591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108878","id":5105268591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMEw3bw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T14:13:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T14:13:06Z","body":"No further discussion has taken place, and @Mickeon's approval now reflects the usability team's, so I'll say this is suitable for integration as-is. We can revisit the implementation later this dev cycle if desired.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5105268591/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1